  "limitations": [
    "Release English: 3 focused repeats per version. Chinese: 2 focused repeats per version; focus-lost runs rejected.",
    "Supplemental development and 60-second runs each use one process, focus recorded rather than required. They are memory observations, not allocation-rate or FPS benchmarks.",
    "Heap capture replaces malloc with tcmalloc; native RSS and GPU counts are measured independently. Do not add GPU GTT/VRAM directly to process RSS.",
    "Development samples with stale Midnight constants from a shared Cargo target directory were excluded; the host crate was rebuilt and replacement samples verify the current palette. Release samples used separately preserved binaries and were unaffected."
  ]
